{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_vrtx_01RT6ipMox8pYvp5goQmuM16","type":"tool_result","content":"name: pipeline-grouping\ndescription: >-\n  Evaluate the pipeline-grouping skill against realistic CI/CD failure\n  snapshots. Tests error similarity grouping, boundary crossing, cascade\n  detection, and Jira dedup handling.\n\nexecution:\n  mode: case\n  skill: pipeline-grouping\n  arguments: \"\"\n  timeout: 600\n\nrunner:\n  type: claude-code\n  plugin_dirs:\n    - .\n\nmodels:\n  skill: claude-sonnet-4-6\n  judge: claude-opus-4-6\n\ndataset:\n  path: eval/cases-grouping\n  schema: |\n    Each case directory contains:\n    - input.yaml: The 'prompt' field is the skill invocation command\n      (always \"/pipeline-grouping\").\n    - annotations.yaml: Expected outcomes (expected_group_count, expected_jobs\n      as comma-separated IDs, expected_grouping array of {root_cause, job_ids}).\n    - _context/grouping-context.json: Job manifest table, expected job IDs,\n      and Jira URL.\n    - jobs/<id>-<name>/errors.txt: Preprocessed error files per job. May start\n      with \"[Fallback:\" if no error patterns matched (raw last 200 log lines).\n    - recent-tickets.json: Open Jira tickets for dedup (may be empty []).\n\noutputs:\n  - path: output\n    schema: |\n      The skill writes to the workspace root (collected into output/):\n      - grouping.json: Final grouping with \"groups\" array. Each group has\n        id (NN-slug format), summary (root cause description), job_ids\n        (sorted numeric strings), error_messages (representative errors).\n      - dedup-results.json: (conditional) Written only when groups match\n        existing Jira tickets from recent-tickets.json.\n\ntraces:\n  stdout: true\n  stderr: true\n  events: true\n  metrics: true","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"27f7c06b-7245-401d-ad05-1888a437cfb3","uuid":"b88f20ce-e7e0-4dc5-a17a-bc32149f71a1","timestamp":"2026-07-20T21:14:06.710Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"name: pipeline-grouping\ndescription: >-\n  Evaluate the pipeline-grouping skill against realistic CI/CD failure\n  snapshots. Tests error similarity grouping, boundary crossing, cascade\n  detection, and Jira dedup handling.\n\nexecution:\n  mode: case\n  skill: pipeline-grouping\n  arguments: \"\"\n  timeout: 600\n\nrunner:\n  type: claude-code\n  plugin_dirs:\n    - .\n\nmodels:\n  skill: claude-sonnet-4-6\n  judge: claude-opus-4-6\n\ndataset:\n  path: eval/cases-grouping\n  schema: |\n    Each case directory contains:\n    - input.yaml: The 'prompt' field is the skill invocation command\n      (always \"/pipeline-grouping\").\n    - annotations.yaml: Expected outcomes (expected_group_count, expected_jobs\n      as comma-separated IDs, expected_grouping array of {root_cause, job_ids}).\n    - _context/grouping-context.json: Job manifest table, expected job IDs,\n      and Jira URL.\n    - jobs/<id>-<name>/errors.txt: Preprocessed error files per job. May start\n      with \"[Fallback:\" if no error patterns matched (raw last 200 log lines).\n    - recent-tickets.json: Open Jira tickets for dedup (may be empty []).\n\noutputs:\n  - path: output\n    schema: |\n      The skill writes to the workspace root (collected into output/):\n      - grouping.json: Final grouping with \"groups\" array. Each group has\n        id (NN-slug format), summary (root cause description), job_ids\n        (sorted numeric strings), error_messages (representative errors).\n      - dedup-results.json: (conditional) Written only when groups match\n        existing Jira tickets from recent-tickets.json.\n\ntraces:\n  stdout: true\n  stderr: true\n  events: true\n  metrics: true","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false}}
